exports[`hand-off package > writes the README and the instructions in English too 1`] = `
"# KM0 hand-off package · 博客评论

1. Put the whole \`km0/\` folder at the root of the target repository.
2. \`km0/agents/\` holds project instructions for each agent; move them where the table says. If the repository already has such a file, merge the content instead of overwriting it.
3. Then run the tasks below in order, either with the command shown or by pasting the task file into the agent.

| # | Task | Tier | Agent | Model | How to start |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 01 | [加评论表](tasks/01.md) | T1 | Claude Code | claude-haiku-5-5 | \`claude --model claude-haiku-5-5 -p "Read km0/tasks/01.md and complete the task it describes."\` |
| 02 | [设计权限](tasks/02.md) | T3 | Codex | gpt-codex-max | \`codex exec -m gpt-codex-max -s workspace-write "Read km0/tasks/02.md and complete the task it describes."\` |

## Using each agent

### Claude Code

Run the command at the repository root (\`-p\` runs non-interactively; drop it for an interactive session). Merge into an existing CLAUDE.md; Claude Code reads AGENTS.md only when there is no CLAUDE.md.

Project instructions: \`km0/agents/CLAUDE.md\` → move to \`CLAUDE.md\`

### Codex

Run the command at the repository root (\`codex exec\` runs non-interactively; \`-s workspace-write\` limits edits to this repository). Drop \`exec\` for an interactive session.

Project instructions: \`km0/agents/AGENTS.md\` → move to \`AGENTS.md\`
"
`;
